# The rival of Hoenn (Emerald's MUS_VS_RIVAL, May's and Brendan's): a bold square lead in B minor that answers itself
# a third higher, over galloping octaves, and a bright D major strain where the two run side by side. Original
# composition for this game (plan 21 · H2).
title Battle! Rival (Hoenn)
tempo 172
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.08
reverb 0.16

